expression:(= vexistecte, 0)
evaluates to f 
expression:(= pconsulta, 0)
evaluates to t 
expression:
  (select (nvl correo_elec, " "), tipo_correo, status_correo
    from bdinteg:"informix".si_correos
    where (and (and (= numcte, pnumcte), (= tipo_correo, ptipocorreo)), (= status_correo, "A")))
evaluates to A ; 1 ; cliente@ejemplo.com                                                                                  ; 
